    },
    {
      "en": "scene bartwofive1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/bartwofive1.webp",
      "alt": "bartwofive1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I decide to spend yet another night at the bar killing time with Sana.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Without me even having to ask, she grabs a beer from the cooler and slides it over to me with an uncharacteristic smile on her face.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": In a good mood tonight?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hm?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why do you ask?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You seem a lot less nervous than usual.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do I?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m just...a little relieved that my mom isn’t around...That’s all.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ahh. Yeah, I can imagine it probably takes a load off of your mind knowing that she can’t show up and randomly embarrass you.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene bartwofive2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/bartwofive2.webp",
      "alt": "bartwofive2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You don’t get the half of it...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s only been getting worse lately too...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Really? Did something happen?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene bartwofive3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/bartwofive3.webp",
      "alt": "bartwofive3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...Explain?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You happened.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Saying it with that sort of expression makes you seem more like Yumi and less like Sana.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Give me back my favorite bartender.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene bartwofive2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/bartwofive2.webp",
      "alt": "bartwofive2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m only kidding...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Though...it is true that my mom has been really annoying ever since you started coming around...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She keeps asking me questions about you and...I have no idea how to answer even half of them...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, what kind of questions? Maybe I can help?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene bartwofive4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/bartwofive4.webp",
      "alt": "bartwofive4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Huh?...Well...it’s not like I’ve...kept track of them or anything...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": They’re mostly just random things like what kind of food you like or...what you do for fun.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene bartwofive2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/bartwofive2.webp",
      "alt": "bartwofive2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think...she thinks we might be closer than we actually are...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, aren’t we?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I like to think that we’ve at least sort of transcended the teacher/student thing by now, right?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well...I don’t think I’ve ever had another teacher who routinely shows up in my room...so I guess so.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But I still don’t know much about you either...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "To be fair, even I don’t know much about myself.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "This version of me, at least.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It’s not like I can just sit down with Ami and ask something like, “Hey, what was I into a couple years ago? How different did I act?”",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It’s a confusing situation.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And it definitely doesn’t help that there isn’t really anything I find appealing other than...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Well, having conversations with [younger_girls] in the middle of the night.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But hey, at least it feels a little more normal talking to one in a bar rather than a porn shop...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well how about this-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you have any questions for me, Sana?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene bartwofive4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/bartwofive4.webp",
      "alt": "bartwofive4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you...going to answer them?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I believe that was implied, yes.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And...are you going to ask me any?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...Do you want me to?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene bartwofive1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/bartwofive1.webp",
      "alt": "bartwofive1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sure...We can make it a sort of...game. Or something...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene bartwofive5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/bartwofive5.webp",
      "alt": "bartwofive5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Like...we could take turns getting to know more about each other...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Something like that might be easier for me since I can’t really...steer conversations myself.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What’s all this about steering conversations?",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene bartwofive6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/bartwofive6.webp",
      "alt": "bartwofive6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...?",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maki?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes! That is me. Maki.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What are you doing here?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Drinking, I hope.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene bartwofive7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/bartwofive7.webp",
      "alt": "bartwofive7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is your mom around tonight, Sana?",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Huh?...Oh, umm...No. She had plans with a friend tonight.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And I wasn’t invited? Damn that tramp.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene bartwofive2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/bartwofive2.webp",
      "alt": "bartwofive2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you know who that woman is?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maki! Do I need to say it even louder?",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s umm...the...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene bartwofive5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/bartwofive5.webp",
      "alt": "bartwofive5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s the...porn-lady...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene bartwofive8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/bartwofive8.webp",
      "alt": "bartwofive8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Maki walks up to the bar and takes her place on the stool directly beside me.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "What sort of woman gets dressed up like that to come to the bar all by herself?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She realizes this place doesn't ever have any customers, right?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Porn-lady isn't really the best nickname I could have asked for. But I guess I can take it.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene bartwofive9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/bartwofive9.webp",
      "alt": "bartwofive9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Heh...Take it.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Like a dick.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Get it?",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes, Maki. I get it.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene bartwofive10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/bartwofive10.webp",
      "alt": "bartwofive10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Were you two in the middle of something? I could have sworn I overheard a chat about the question-game.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Y-Yes...We were going to do...something like that...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But I don’t think we were going to ask the sort of questions you’d be interested in...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": At least I hope not...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hmm okay, okay. Well don’t let me interrupt you.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Could I bother you for a glass of wine, though?",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh...umm...Sure.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll be right back...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene bartwofive11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/bartwofive11.webp",
      "alt": "bartwofive11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sana walks to the other end of the counter and opens a brand new bottle of red wine, pouring it carefully into a glass.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Another student of yours?",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Another student of mine.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you have any girls who don’t work in businesses not suited for their age group?",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A few. None as impressive as a porn shop, though.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think that’s the first time anyone’s referred to my shop as impressive.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Thank you for your kind words. I’ll knock 500 yen off of your next fleshlight in order to thank you for them.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You truly know the way to a man’s heart, don’t you?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene bartwofive12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/bartwofive12.webp",
      "alt": "bartwofive12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sana comes back a minute or two later and places a glass in front of Maki, who immediately picks it up and begins sipping away.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...take it you two know each other?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Know each other? We’re practically inseparable.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We’ve hung out a couple times.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s...worrying.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What’s truly worrying is your mother, dear.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is she okay?",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene bartwofive13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/bartwofive13.webp",
      "alt": "bartwofive13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...think so? Why do you ask?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, because she was one of my regular customers and I haven’t been seeing her much at all lately.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sara is a regular at the porn shop?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene bartwofive14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/bartwofive14.webp",
      "alt": "bartwofive14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, please. If I had a dollar for every dildo I’ve sold that woman, I’d have enough to open two more stores.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’d hope that you’re profiting at least a dollar from every sex toy you sell.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You might need to raise your prices if that’s not the case.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Umm...can we...talk about something else?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t really...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene bartwofive15",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/bartwofive15.webp",
      "alt": "bartwofive15"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh gosh. Of course! I forgot how innocent and untainted you are. So different from your perverted mother.",
      "spk": "Maki",
      "spkColor": "#4DADDE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This is probably why you weren’t invited out tonight, Maki.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene bartwofive16",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/bartwofive16.webp",
      "alt": "bartwofive16"
